"text": "studio-context-classifier \u2014 Decision-context gate\nDO: classifies clear/complicated/complex/chaotic/disorder, records confidence and the matching response mode before leverage\nNOT: select leverage, authorize intervention, or silently turn disorder into a plan", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "originalText": "studio-context-classifier \u2014 Decision-context gate\nDO: classifies clear/complicated/complex/chaotic/disorder, records confidence and the matching response mode before leverage\nNOT: select leverage, authorize intervention, or silently turn disorder into a plan", "lineHeight": 1.25, "containerId": null}, {"id": "agent-5", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1960, "y": 387, "width": 590, "height": 102, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f1f3f5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2106127462, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1524589569, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "agent-5t", "type": "text", "x": 1970, "y": 395, "width": 570, "height": 86, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1008531434, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 962214210, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "studio-phase-agents \u2014 One owner per phase\nDO: produce the named phase artifact and hand off only on gate green\nNOT: cross phase ownership without an explicit packet", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "originalText": "studio-phase-agents \u2014 One owner per phase\nDO: produce the named phase artifact and hand off only on gate green\nNOT: cross phase ownership without an explicit p